&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Alpaca is a US-headquartered, global leader in agent-first brokerage infrastructure&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;for stocks, ETFs, options, crypto, fixed income, 24/5 trading, and more.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Amongst our subsidiaries, Alpaca is a licensed financial services company, serving hundreds of financial institutions across 40 countries with our institutional-grade APIs. This includes broker-dealers, investment advisors, wealth managers, hedge funds, and crypto exchanges, totalling over 10 million brokerage accounts.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our global team is a diverse group of experienced engineers, traders, and brokerage professionals who are working to achieve our mission of opening financial services to everyone on the planet. We&#39;re deeply committed to open-source contributions and fostering a vibrant community, continuously enhancing our award-winning, developer-friendly API and the robust infrastructure behind it.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Alpaca is proudly backed by $400 million in funding from top-tier global investors including Portage Ventures, Spark Capital, Tribe Capital, Social Leverage, Horizons Ventures, Opera Tech Ventures, SBI Group, Derayah Financial, Unbound, Peak XV, Elefund, and Y Combinator.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Team Members:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re a dynamic team of 400+ globally distributed members who thrive working from our favorite places around the world, with teammates spanning the USA, Canada, Japan, Hungary, Nigeria, Brazil, the UK, and beyond!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We&#39;re searching for passionate individuals eager to contribute to Alpaca&#39;s rapid growth. If you align with our core values—Stay Curious, Have Empathy, and Be Accountable—and are ready to make a significant impact, we encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a high-performing Account Executive with a proven track record of selling technology or financial services solutions to broker-dealers, registered investment advisers (RIAs), and other financial institutions.&amp;nbsp; You will be on the front lines of growing Alpaca&#39;s market share by managing the full sales cycle, from prospecting and qualification to solution design, proposal development, negotiation, and closing new business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will help fintechs, broker-dealers, RIAs, wealth management firms, and banks launch and scale brokerage products using Alpaca&#39;s institutional Broker API and brokerage infrastructure.&amp;nbsp; You&#39;ll partner with fintech platforms, broker-dealers, registered investment advisers (RIAs), wealth management firms, banks, and other financial institutions to help them launch and scale brokerage products, with a primary focus on clients across the United States.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success in this role requires a consultative sales approach, strong business acumen, excellent time management, and the ability to effectively manage multiple priorities while navigating complex, multi-stakeholder sales cycles. You are a collaborative team player who is self-motivated, driven to win, and committed to delivering exceptional results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our team is 100% distributed and remote, with a preference for candidates located in New York, Chicago, or Austin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Things You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the full sales cycle from outbound prospecting through contract negotiation and close&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and manage a healthy pipeline through outbound outreach, referrals, conferences, strategic partnerships, networking, and inbound opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive new revenue growth for Alpaca&#39;s institutional Broker API business across the United States&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop relationships with key decision makers at fintechs, broker-dealers, RIAs, wealth managers, banks, and other financial institutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand each prospect&#39;s business objectives and technical requirements to position Alpaca&#39;s solutions effectively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver compelling product demonstrations, business presentations, and commercial proposals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with Solutions Engineering, Product, Integrations, Marketing, Customer Success, and Legal to move opportunities efficiently through the sales process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate pipeline data, forecasts, and account activity within Salesforce (or CRM)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously refine sales messaging based on market feedback, customer insights, and competitive intelligence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Alpaca at industry conferences, customer meetings, and networking events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are (Must-Haves):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience selling technology or financial services solutions to broker-dealers, registered investment advisers (RIAs), wealth management firms, or other financial institutions. Experience within a clearing broker-dealer or brokerage infrastructure provider is strongly preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of achieving sales targets and driving business growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience selling to and building trusted relationships with broker-dealers, RIAs, and other financial institutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing complex, multi-stakeholder enterprise sales cycles involving business, operations, compliance, legal, and technical stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong consultative selling, negotiation, and relationship-building skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized with strong pipeline management and forecasting discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working independently in a globally distributed remote environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entrepreneurial mindset with a bias toward action and accountability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must have Series 7&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you Might Be (Nice-to-Haves):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling APIs, developer platforms, or financial infrastructure products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with brokerage, securities trading, wealth management, or capital markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with startups or high-growth technology companies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Existing network within the US fintech ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with HubSpot, Salesforce, or a comparable CRM platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Series 24/63/65 licenses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How We Take Care of You:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive Salary &amp;amp; Stock Options&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Health Benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;New Hire Home-Office Setup: One-time USD $500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Monthly Stipend: USD $150 per month via a Brex Card&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Alpaca is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace dedicated to pursuing and hiring a diverse workforce.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
